        "title": "Typography - Overview: Frozen Language",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nTENSION 1: REPRODUCTION FIDELITY vs SPEED\n──────────────────────────────────────────\nHand-carved letters           Fast scribes\n   vs manuscript                  vs\nGutenberg moveable type       Hand composition (~1000 chars/hr)\n   vs Linotype slug casting\nPostScript outline rendering  Bitmap fonts (fast, ugly)\n   vs pre-rendered bitmaps"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#011",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:typography:00-overview, git-history:typography:00-overview]",
