        "root_concepts": "[overview]",
        "section": "typography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Typography - Overview: Frozen Language",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TENSION 2: BEAUTY vs ECONOMY\n─────────────────────────────\nIncised stone capitals         Beautiful, labor-intensive\n   vs uncial                Faster, slightly less refined\nCustom type designs            Expensive, differentiated\n   vs system fonts          Free, indistinguishable\nVariable font design axes      Infinite nuance\n   vs fixed weight/style    Simpler tooling"
    },
    {
